  "analysis": "\n\n• **Prévia Assurances (d1, d2, d3)** | 3 docs, €1 704\n  - *d1:* Debited from SELARL but names Hélène (“Assurée : Mme Hélène Morel”). *d2:* Names Paul with no business entity. *d3:* Subscribed by SELARL for Hélène (“Souscripteur : SELARL…”). Fact to settle: personal vs business expense status.\n  - *Q:* Should these contracts be personal or business expenses?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* “All personal” → Always personal; “d1/d3 business, d2 personal” → Depends on discriminator (insured person); “All business” → Always SELARL.\n\n• **Atelier Bois & Co (d5, d6)** | 2 docs, €6 250\n  - *d5:* Addressee is personal despite site “4 rue du Port” (LMNP). *d6:* Missing site address despite “salle de stérilisation” implying practice. Fact to settle: entity owning the works.\n  - *Q:* Are these works for the practice or the flat?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* “Practice” → Always SELARL; “Flat” → Always LMNP; “Mixed” → Depends on discriminator (site address).\n\n• **Banque Rivage (d4)** | 1 doc, €0\n  - *d4:* Account not in registry; receives LMNP rent (“LOYER 4 RUE DU PORT MAI 650,00”) but titled to Paul (“Titulaire : M OU MME MOREL PAUL”). Fact to settle: account ownership.\n  - *Q:* Is this account personal or LMNP?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* “Personal” → Always personal; “LMNP” → Always LMNP; “Mixed” → Ask each time (depends on transaction nature).\n\n• **Orélia Télécom (d7)** | 1 doc, €39,99\n  - *d7:* Box at LMNP site but billed to Paul personally (“Titulaire : M. Paul Morel”). Fact to settle: usage vs billing match.\n  - *Q:* Is the internet box personal or for the flat?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* “Personal” → Always personal; “LMNP” → Always LMNP; “Shared” → Depends on discriminator (usage split).",
